{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "zTp7U0okdv", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Tom Brokaw (New York)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763171, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "mCjGwUEk9g", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Iraq / Prisoner Abuse Scandal", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (Mannheim, Germany: Fred Francis) The findings of the report of the commission that investigated the abuse of prisoners at Abu Ghraib in Iraq featured; details given of the conclusion that there were gaps & confusion in command and that top military leaders are culpable. [Abu Ghraib panel chairman James SCHLESINGER&#134;- says it was a kind of animal house on the night shift.] [Commission member Tillie FOWLER&#134;- comments on leadership failures.] The hearings in Germany for the soldiers accused in the scandal noted. [Accused MP S/Sgt. Ivan \u201cChip\u201d Frederick\u2019s attorney Gary MYERS&#134;- says after today, we will no longer hear that it was just 7 rogue soldiers.] [FREDERICK \u2013 says everything went downhill since we got to Abu Ghraib.]", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63040.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763172, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "PzAyY1EcqV", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Guantanamo Bay, Cuba / Tribunals", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (Washington: Pete Williams) The opening at Guantanamo Bay, Cuba, of the military commission to try suspects held as enemy combatants and charged with war crimes featured; courtroom sketches by Art Lien shown; details given of the trial for Salim Hamdan&#134;&#134;, a driver for Al Qaeda leader Osama bin Laden, and charges that the process is unfair; commission rules outlined. [In November, 2001, President BUSH \u2013 comments on the commission\u2019s orders.] [Former federal prosecutor Neal SONNETT&#134;- says we do not have to give up freedoms & rights and do away with due process.] [Appeals court lawyer Tom GOLDSTEIN&#134;- relates the uncertainty over how to deal with the detainees.]", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63190.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763173, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "0OsVXr7zvX", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Russia / Plane Crashes", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) The crash of two planes in Bulchalki & Rostov-on-Don, Russia, at almost the same time reported.", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763174, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "dVlonyv4mm", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Iraq Watch", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) The US assault against radical cleric Muqtada al-Sadr\u2019s rebels near the holy shrine in Najaf, Iraq, and the bombing of the convoys of 2 Iraqi cabinet ministers in Baghdad reported; scenes shown.", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63350.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763175, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "x7KNXwZOUg", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Olympic Games / Iraqi Soccer Team", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced.   (Athens: Brian Williams) Events at the Olympic Games in Athens, Greece, reviewed; details given about an earthquake centered in the Aegean Sea, the withdrawal of US athlete Tom Pappas from the decathlon, and the increase in ticket sales; photos & scenes shown.   (Thessaloniki, Greece: Richard Engel) The wish of many Iraqi soccer players not to return to Iraq after the Olympics featured; scenes shown of their game against Paraguay, which they lost, and of Iraqi fans; details given of offers for Iraqi players to join professional European teams. [Former coach Bernd STANGE&#134;&#134;- says he is sure the players will leave.]   (Athens: Brian Williams) The day\u2019s results reviewed.", "segment_duration": 200, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63390.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763176, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "d2C5kBFBjt", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63590.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763177, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "x70tkcerKY", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Crest Whitestrips; Imitrex; Gas-X; Plavix; \"Today.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63620.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763178, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "7PW5vsKByf", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "In Depth (Kerry\u2019s War Record)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Vice President Dick Cheney\u2019s acknowledgement that he has a gay daughter, his views on same-sex relationships & marriage, and Senator John Kerry\u2019s campaign appearance in New York City, where he accused President Bush of using smear tactics to avoid debating real issues noted. [In Davenport, Iowa, CHENEY \u2013 says people ought to be free to enter any relationship they want to.] \n (Bogue, Kansas: Lisa Myers) The views of former Swift boat Lt. Larry Thurlow&#134;&#134; on his disagreement with Kerry\u2019s account of his Vietnam war experience presented; animation shown of the incident in which Kerry rescued crewmate Jim Rassmann; details given about a conflict involving Thurlow\u2019s acceptance of a Bronze Star and discrepancies in Kerry\u2019s version of events. [THURLOW \u2013 says Kerry lied to manufacture a third Purple Heart; states the plan was to use his Vietnam experience as a platform into a career in politics; asserts there was no enemy fire during the incident.] [RASSMANN \u2013 says Kerry put his life on the line.]", "segment_duration": 280, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63750.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763179, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "p7sXjApYt5", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64030.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763180, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "43VXPUiyAi", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "(Commercial: L\u2019Oreal; Beneful; Hyundai Santa Fe; Serenity; St. Joseph; \"Hardball.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64040.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763181, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "mBq77Z6bu5", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Medicine: Mercury in Fish", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) The EPA\u2019s caution against eating fish from certain lakes & rivers due to mercury poisoning noted.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64210.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763182, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "j556xTVLSG", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "LifeLine (Hysterectomies)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (Denver: Robert Bazell) Uterine artery embolization {UAE}, a non-surgical treatment for women with fibroid tumors that is an alternative to hysterectomies featured; details given of the reluctance of gynecologists to give up the fee for performing a hysterectomy to the radiologists who do UAEs. [Patient Laura ROGERS&#134;&#134;- expresses frustration about not being told about UAE.] [Northwestern Memorial Hospital Dr. Howard CHRISMAN&#134;- says financial considerations play a role for some gynecologists.] [Denver Health Medical Center\u2019s Dr. Charles CODDINGTON&#134;&#134;- says many women choose to have a hysterectomy.] [Radiologist Chuck RAY&#134;&#134;- notes there are no long-term results for UAE.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64240.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763183, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "Yk4Qd9Npwl", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Stock Market Report (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64370.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763184, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763171, "segment_id": "O9k5L5QuHD", "segment_broadcast_id": "xE6jhv4yt6", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64380.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763185, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "br